Phase 2 (FullSpectrum engine emission): register the 15 FS mixed-
filament + dithering keys as project-scoped options in
PresetBundle::s_project_options.

Ported from FS v0.9.9 (`ratdoux/OrcaSlicer-FullSpectrum@v0.9.9` commit
b3c41fda), `src/libslic3r/PresetBundle.cpp` lines 73-87 — the
project-options list that decides which keys are persisted in
`Metadata/project_settings.config` inside a saved 3MF.

Why this matters:

`PresetBundle::project_config.apply_only(config, s_project_options)`
copies ONLY keys in this list when materializing project config.
Keys absent from the list silently drop on save — they live in
DynamicPrintConfig at slice time but aren't persisted to the 3MF.

Without this patch, a user authors a mixed-filament row, saves the
project as .3mf, reopens it — the virtual rows are GONE. The
`mixed_filament_definitions` config never made it into the saved
project_settings.config because it wasn't in `s_project_options`.

Adds the 15 FS keys: mixed_filament_gradient_mode,
height_lower_bound, height_upper_bound, advanced_dithering,
component_bias_enabled, surface_indentation, region_collapse,
definitions, mixed_color_layer_height_a/b, dithering_z_step_size,
dithering_local_z_mode, dithering_local_z_whole_objects,
dithering_local_z_direct_multicolor, dithering_step_painted_zones_only.

Verified compile-clean via incremental libslic3r rebuild (2/2, 0
FAILED) + ./gradlew :app:assembleDebug (full APK built).

Hard dependencies:
  - patch 0027 (PrintConfig.hpp typed declarations)
  - patch 0038 (PrintConfig.cpp this->add(...) registrations)

Companion to:
  - patch 0034 (s_Preset_print_options for the 3 region keys)

